<PageTitle>Terms · Alfar Quest</PageTitle>

<article class="aq-doc">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>

    <p class="aq-doc-lede">
        Alfar Quest is a game built around the music it takes its story from. These are
        the terms in the same spirit — short, and meant to be read.
    </p>

    <h2>Your account</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>One account per person. Keep your password to yourself.</li>
        <li>You are responsible for what happens under your account.</li>
        <li>Tell us if you think someone else has your password, and change it.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What you upload</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Avatars must be images you have the right to use.</li>
        <li>Anything unlawful, or made to harass, will be removed with the account.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>The game itself</h2>
    <p>
        It is offered as it is. Progress is stored on a best-effort basis; this is not a
        service with an uptime promise behind it.
    </p>

    <p class="aq-doc-foot"><a class="aq-link" href="/">Back to the gate</a></p>
</article>
